<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13106] Java thin client: Race between response and notification for compute tasks </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13106</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Java thin client &lt;tt&gt;ClientCompute.execute()&lt;/tt&gt; method&#160;can hang due to race between processing of COMPUTE_TASK_EXECUTE response&#160;and COMPUTE_TASK_FINISHED notification.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;These messages are strongly ordered on the server-side. But on the client-side response and notification are processed by different threads. If notification will be processed before response, task future will never be completed.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
